<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs end firm ahead exchange auction.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs end firm ahead exchange auction.</headline>
<text>
<p>1530 GMT - Belgian linear bond futures ended firmer but off early highs on Monday, as new volume at Tuesday's exchange auction weighed on the market. Outlook still unclear.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.88% (5.88) BE286=,  9 bps over Bunds ( 8)  MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut +11 bp  BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6368/73 (35/45)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.22/27% (22/25), 1-wk repo 3.23/27   TTFBXL</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
